summary:
  The step back is shown whenever the pill is.

history:
  Only a sliding buffer has an earlier place a new open can land in. On
  the single file (FLAC, Ogg, the relay) a step would be a press that does
  nothing.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ShiftPill.qml

find:
          visible: shiftPill.stepReady
          enabledState: visible
          iconName: "media-seek-backward"

replace:
          visible: true
          enabledState: visible
          iconName: "media-seek-backward"

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_shiftpill.qml::test_the_single_file_keeps_its_pill_and_has_no_steps.
